18
00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.580
Well, no. – Why? – No, it can't.

19
00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:25.940
Oh, come on. I still cuddle you. And what do I get from you, I swear?

20
00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:31.740
Brain massage and all those stories: you can't do this much, you can do that much.

21
